# Product — Easy Downloader

Professional desktop download manager for permitted media only.

## Capabilities

- Analyze supported media URLs
- Select video and audio formats
- Download individual items; manage queues
- Download playlists where permitted
- View history; manage downloaded files

## Legal use

Only for content the user owns, has permission to download, or is legally permitted to save. Do not add circumvention, DRM bypass, or unauthorized access features.

## Stack

Frontend: React, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Zustand  
Desktop: Tauri 2, Rust  
Data: SQLite  
Media: yt-dlp, FFmpeg

## Development

Inspect existing code before large features. Plan, implement incrementally, typecheck, lint, and test. Never rewrite the entire project unless explicitly requested.
